{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50141","headline":"咏汉武帝（斯二七一七下同） · 王无竞","name":"咏汉武帝（斯二七一七下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家中叶盛，六世有雄才。\n廐马三十万，国容何壮裁（哉）！东历琅琊郡，北上单于台。\n好僊复宠战，莫救茂陵●[一]。\n（蒋云「●」以作隈爲是，「隈」有败坏之义。\n）（[一]「●」字不可识，疑当作「隈」。\n刘云：「『隈』当是煨之误。」\n《说文》：煨，烬余火也。\n茂陵虽未闻焚烧之事，然陈沈烱《经通天台奏汉武帝表》云：「茂陵玉椀，遂出人间，云凌故基，与原田而每每；扶风余趾，带陵阜而芒芒」，亦正是茂陵煨烬的写照了。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王无竞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}